	('cfaf69f7-763b-4691-9cf4-787dc41166b7', '83f40d0e-4797-4e3c-b72a-fedf73e63286', 1, 'RISK_PROFILE_V1', 'INITIAL_IMPORT', 'DIGITAL_DATA', 'MANAGE_DELIVERY', 'DEPLOY', 'APPROVAL_REQUIRED', 'AI Model Explainability', 'The AI model of the digital solution must have adequate information aviailable to faciliate explainability of its operations.', 'DFC-QU-STD-0000534-AI Systems Risk and Compliance Management: https://api-eu.sanofi.com:8443/smartlink/api/qualipso/8038280', 'AI Model behaviour described using the AI Model ID card', '', 'OUTCOME_TRIGGERED', '{"groups": [{"conditions": [{"values": ["AI_HIGH"], "operator": "IN", "outcomeKey": "AI_RISK_CLASSIFICATION"}]}]}', 'seed-user-admin-clara', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'AI'),
	('6fc3c047-b912-4175-a7c8-66c060e6d5bb', '7d3b90cd-a62d-479a-aea9-7b3c4a697c00', 1, 'RISK_PROFILE_V1', 'INITIAL_IMPORT', 'CYBER_SECURITY', 'MANAGE_SECURITY', 'BUILD', 'APPROVAL_REQUIRED', 'Threat Modeling', 'Threats must be identified so that risky scenarios can be understood and mitigated.', 'QU-STD-0000469 Secure Development of Applications: https://api-eu.sanofi.com:8443/smartlink/api/qualipso/910529', 'Cybersecurity Threat assessment describing the cyber security risks which can impact the digital solution and the mitigition plan.', '', 'OUTCOME_TRIGGERED', '{"groups": [{"conditions": [{"values": ["OPELLA_MANAGED_PLATFORM"], "operator": "IN", "outcomeKey": "PLATFORM_HOSTING"}]}]}', 'seed-user-admin-clara', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'CYBERSECURITY'),
	('372418f5-0c77-419e-aaa3-ba713f03ddba', 'c52e91f5-8013-44c4-ba50-5f2e1e49abb3', 1, 'RISK_PROFILE_V1', 'INITIAL_IMPORT', 'DIGITAL_RISK_AND_COMPLIANCE', 'MANAGE_SUPPLIER', 'BUILD', 'APPROVAL_REQUIRED', 'Contract', 'According to a risk based approach based on the third party risk identification process,  the Digital Opella contract Owner (the person requesting and managing the contract process) must ensure that Quality contractual Clauses, Cyber Security measures, and Data Privacy Agreements relevant to the scope of services* are included in a contract with the third party.   

*Note : a Contract, including Master Service Agreement can cover services related to one or several digital solutions.', '1. DFC-QU-GOP-0000498-CS Third Party Quality Management - Sourcing, Contracting, Management and Termination: https://api-eu.sanofi.com:8443/smartlink/api/qualipso/724974 
2. DFC-QU-STD-0000412-Third Parties / Contractors Cybersecurity requirements: https://api-eu.sanofi.com:8443/smartlink/api/qualipso/807189', 'Reference of established contract, agreement or Purchase order including proper clauses for each 3rd party used.', 'When attesting this control, consider the following:

For each Third Party providing or supporting the digital solution (SaaS system, On-Premise Software, Middleware, Infrastructure or Platform provider, Managed Services, Outsourced services):

- For Third Party identified as a “High Risk third party”* the control is to be attested in alignement with compliance status found into the High-Risk Third-Party dashboard.
 
Otherwise:
 
For Third Party supporting a GxP  feature / process: 
- Are quality contractual clauses signed by authorized Opella and third party signatories, included into the contract and stored in a contract management system? If not, has a quality contractual clause exemption form been approved by the Contract owner?  

- If the contract is up for renewal by end of the current year, and the contractual clauses have been signed for more than 5 years, is a gap assessment documented and an action plan defined for remediations?
 
For Third-Party that either accesses, stores or manages Opella information, has access to Opella systems, or has privileged access, or supports a vital process: Are the Cyber contractual measures included into the contract?
 
For Third-Party processing personal data: Is the Data Privacy Agreement included into the contract?
 
* A High Risk Third Party is a provider supporting either a Vital activity or handling high risk data (highly sensitive data, sensitive personal data or GxP  / SOX relevant data).', 'OUTCOME_TRIGGERED', '{"groups": [{"conditions": [{"values": ["THIRD_PARTY_ENGAGED"], "operator": "IN", "outcomeKey": "THIRD_PARTY_ENGAGEMENT"}]}]}', 'seed-user-admin-clara', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'CYBERSECURITY'),
	('28cc5837-0d44-425e-af02-26c31a63c8ca', '4c884aa7-cba3-414b-8573-34533e31b1b3', 1, 'RISK_PROFILE_V1', 'INITIAL_IMPORT', 'CYBER_SECURITY', 'MANAGE_SECURITY', 'BUILD', 'APPROVAL_REQUIRED', 'Cyber Security Code Scan', 'Vulnerabilities at code level of the digital solution must be identified and remediated. Additionally, if open source dependencies within the code are used then they must be reviewed to ensure proper use.', 'QU-STD-0000469 Secure Development of Applications:  https://api-eu.sanofi.com:8443/smartlink/api/qualipso/910529', 'Result of the code scan with list of vulnerabilities detected and indicating that no critical/high vulnerabilities remains open.', 'When attesting this control, consider the following:

 - Is the code of the digital solution stored into Opella GitHub repository?
 - Has a Cybersecurity code scan been requested and completed, before the release into production, to detect potential vulnerabilities?
 - Is a proof available, including at least: the list of vulnerabilities detected, the scan identifier, the date of the scan, the branch that was scanned, the result of the scan (SCA, SAST...) and name of the person who realized the screenshot and the timestamp?
 - If Critical/High vulnerabilities have been identified, have they been remediated before deployment in Production?

If open-source code is used:
 - Have we ensured compliance usage with the license terms (e.g. use for commercial purposes allowed, number of workstations allowed)?', 'OUTCOME_TRIGGERED', '{"groups": [{"conditions": [{"values": ["EXTERNALLY_MANAGED_PLATFORM"], "operator": "IN", "outcomeKey": "PLATFORM_HOSTING"}]}, {"conditions": [{"values": ["LIKE_EXTERNAL"], "operator": "IN", "outcomeKey": "PLATFORM_TYPE"}]}, {"conditions": [{"values": ["FULLY_MANAGED"], "operator": "IN", "outcomeKey": "PLATFORM_TYPE"}]}]}', 'seed-user-admin-clara', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', '{"outcomeKey": "PLATFORM_TYPE", "acceptedValues": ["FULLY_MANAGED"]}', NULL, 'CYBERSECURITY'),
	('79c53347-062d-4143-a313-e9b0f4f155e2', '048a089b-b62f-422a-94cb-b22b51ee0f48', 1, 'RISK_PROFILE_V1', 'INITIAL_IMPORT', 'CYBER_SECURITY', 'MANAGE_SECURITY', 'BUILD', 'APPROVAL_REQUIRED', 'Cloud Security Posture', 'Vulnerabilities of cloud environment of the digital solution must be identified and remediated.', 'DIG-CO-STD-0000031-Systems Security Standard:https://opella-connect.veevavault.com/ui/#permalink=V190000000IV019', 'PRISMA cloud service monitoring report indicating that no medium or high vulnerabilities are open.', '', 'OUTCOME_TRIGGERED', '{"groups": [{"conditions": [{"values": ["EXTERNALLY_MANAGED_PLATFORM"], "operator": "IN", "outcomeKey": "PLATFORM_HOSTING"}]}]}', 'seed-user-admin-clara', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'CYBERSECURITY'),
	('9c096d75-bcd8-4c01-8000-08d16fc83aff', '30f8d119-a90f-415d-b62e-dbac12e7ff64', 1, 'RISK_PROFILE_V1', 'INITIAL_IMPORT', 'CYBER_SECURITY', 'MANAGE_SECURITY', 'BUILD', 'APPROVAL_REQUIRED', 'Vulnerability Lifecycle Program', 'Infrastructure vulnerability exposure of the digital solution must be monitored all along its lifecycle to ensure it is exempt from known vulnerabilities.', 'DIG-CO-STD-0000031-Systems Security Standard: https://opella-connect.veevavault.com/ui/#permalink=V190000000IV019', '', '', 'OUTCOME_TRIGGERED', '{"groups": [{"conditions": [{"values": ["WEBSITE"], "operator": "IN", "outcomeKey": "PROPERTY_TYPE"}]}, {"conditions": [{"values": ["FULLY_MANAGED"], "operator": "IN", "outcomeKey": "PLATFORM_TYPE"}]}]}', 'seed-user-admin-clara', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', '{"outcomeKey": "PLATFORM_TYPE", "acceptedValues": ["FULLY_MANAGED"]}', NULL, 'CYBERSECURITY'),
	('7c77acb5-f5d1-45a6-b9eb-635f8f2f579d', '4fe88662-9c7e-47e3-8895-2f7a67240875', 1, 'RISK_PROFILE_V1', 'INITIAL_IMPORT', 'CYBER_SECURITY', 'MANAGE_SECURITY', 'BUILD', 'APPROVAL_REQUIRED', 'Cyber Pentest', 'Attacks must be simulated to identify overall vulnerabilities before releasing the digital solution to production .', 'DIG-CO-STD-0000031-Systems Security Standard: https://opella-connect.veevavault.com/ui/#permalink=V190000000IV019', 'Cyber pentest report summarizing the simulation of the attacks on the digital solution executed and critial risks remediated.', '', 'OUTCOME_TRIGGERED', '{"groups": [{"conditions": [{"values": ["HIGHLY_CONFIDENTIAL"], "operator": "IN", "outcomeKey": "CONFIDENTIALITY_CLASSIFICATION"}]}, {"conditions": [{"values": ["FULLY_MANAGED"], "operator": "IN", "outcomeKey": "PLATFORM_TYPE"}]}]}', 'seed-user-admin-clara', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', '{"outcomeKey": "PLATFORM_TYPE", "acceptedValues": ["FULLY_MANAGED"]}', NULL, 'CYBERSECURITY'),
	('a750035a-8bb5-44c8-bbd2-ab9070930784', 'b1a2d611-7a8a-49b5-89dc-33500cef446f', 1, 'RISK_PROFILE_V1', 'INITIAL_IMPORT', 'CYBER_SECURITY', 'MANAGE_SECURITY', 'BUILD', 'APPROVAL_REQUIRED', 'China Digital Compliance Requirement', 'If the digital solution is used in China:
It must comply with laws and regulations under China''s cyber security and data security regime.

For digital solutions hosted outside Mainland China: If No personal information or only Technical Personal data is collected from Mainland China, this control is not applicable. Otherwise a China Cross-Border Data Transfer – Personal Information (CBDT-PI) risk review must be included.

For digital solutions hosted in Mainland China: this control must be addressed.', 'QU-GOP-0001332 China Digital Compliance Framework: https://api-eu.sanofi.com:8443/smartlink/api/qualipso/8565258', '', '', 'OUTCOME_TRIGGERED', '{"groups": [{"conditions": [{"values": ["USED_IN_CHINA"], "operator": "IN", "outcomeKey": "TERRITORIAL_COMPLIANCE_EXTENSION"}]}]}', 'seed-user-admin-clara', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'CYBERSECURITY'),
