	('6d2b9281-1642-4f96-a86b-505533567032', 'f9c5e79c-8a32-45a6-a11a-c85d7d1637ba', 1, 'RISK_PROFILE_V1', 'INITIAL_IMPORT', 'DIGITAL_RISK_AND_COMPLIANCE', 'MANAGE_SUPPLIER', 'BUILD', 'APPROVAL_REQUIRED', 'Identify Third Party Risk', 'Third Party Risk must be identified during any sourcing activity in order to determine applicable due diligence and contracting actions to be executed prior to final qualification for the Cyber, Data Privacy, and Quality risk domains. A Non-Disclosure Agreement must be signed by both Opella and the 3rd Party to create a confidential relationship if applicable to conduct due diligence activities.', '1. DIG-CO-SOP-0018146-System Life Cycle: https://opella-connect.veevavault.com/ui/#permalink=V190000000IO009
2. For Quality: DFC-QU-GOP-0000498-CS Third Party Quality Management - Sourcing, Contracting, Management and Termination: https://api-eu.sanofi.com:8443/smartlink/api/qualipso/724974
