	('8542bcb7-6365-4ee0-aaf0-08ac98ead96e', '857b8a53-81a1-44fb-b261-b1d96a8ed322', 1, 'RISK_PROFILE_V1', 'INITIAL_IMPORT', 'DIGITAL_RISK_AND_COMPLIANCE', 'MANAGE_SUPPLIER', 'BUILD', 'APPROVAL_REQUIRED', '3rd Party Assessments', 'According to a risk based approach based on the third party risk identification process, an assessment of the 3rd Party is performed in order to evaluate quality, cyber and data privacy compliance. The results of this assessment are documented; it confirms the 3rd party meets Opella requirements to begin providing the solution or service.   

For SOX digital solutions and associated infrastructure components under the scope of the SOX annual campaign: A yearly independent assessment must be provided for any service outsourced to a Third Party so that compliance assurance is obtained.', '1. DFC-QU-GOP-0000498-CS Third Party Quality Management - Sourcing, Contracting, Management and Termination: https://api-eu.sanofi.com:8443/smartlink/api/qualipso/724974
2. DFC-QU-GOP-0000204-Computerized Systems Third-Party Assessments: https://api-eu.sanofi.com:8443/smartlink/api/qualipso/351770 
3. DFC-QU-STD-0000412-Third Parties / Contractors Cybersecurity requirements: https://api-eu.sanofi.com:8443/smartlink/api/qualipso/807189', 'Third party Assessments performed including: third party audit/assessment report, Cyber Security certificates evaluation or completed VIRP, Data Privacy assessment.', 'When attesting this control, consider the following:

For each Third Party providing or supporting the digital solution (SaaS system, On-Premise Software, Middleware, Infrastructure or Platform provider, Managed Services, Outsourced services):
 
For Third Party identified as a “High Risk third party”*, the control is to be attested in alignement with compliance status found into the High-Risk Third-Party dashboard.
 
Otherwise, 
 
- For Quality Assessment:
Based on the Third Party Risk Identification form result for the Third Party, if a Quality Assessment or Quality audit was required, has it been executed and recorded into CONNECT?

- For VIRP (Cyber-Security) Assessment:
If the Third-Party either accesses, stores or manage Opella information, has access to Opella systems, or has privileged access, or supports a vital process: Has a VIRP assessment been completed and registered in the CyberVadis tool?
 
- For Data Privacy Assessment :
If the Third Party processes personal data: Has a Data Privacy assessment been performed in OneTrust?
 
* A High Risk Third Party is a provider supporting either supporting a Vital activity or handling high risk data (highly sensitive data, sensitive personal data or GxP  / SOX relevant data).', 'OUTCOME_TRIGGERED', '{"groups": [{"conditions": [{"values": ["THIRD_PARTY_ENGAGED"], "operator": "IN", "outcomeKey": "THIRD_PARTY_ENGAGEMENT"}]}]}', 'seed-user-admin-clara', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'CYBERSECURITY'),
	('e85cfb22-2fbb-4428-ba71-d915d7b965cf', '8447c712-01d9-432f-bb7b-d25c3d7998e9', 1, 'RISK_PROFILE_V1', 'INITIAL_IMPORT', 'DIGITAL_RISK_AND_COMPLIANCE', 'MANAGE_SUPPLIER', 'RUN', 'APPROVAL_REQUIRED', '3rd Party Monitoring and Termination', 'Relevant 3rd Party failures potentially impacting the data integrity, security, or privacy aspects associated to the digital solution as well as 3rd Party termination must be reported, assessed and addressed in order to minimize impact and restore controls.', '1. DFC-QU-GOP-0000498-CS Third Party Quality Management - Sourcing, Contracting, Management and Termination: https://api-eu.sanofi.com:8443/smartlink/api/qualipso/724974
2. DFC-QU-GOP-0000204-Computerized Systems Third-Party Assessments: https://api-eu.sanofi.com:8443/smartlink/api/qualipso/351770
3. DFC-QU-STD-0000412-Third Parties / Contractors Cybersecurity requirements: https://api-eu.sanofi.com:8443/smartlink/api/qualipso/807189', '', '', 'OUTCOME_TRIGGERED', '{"groups": [{"conditions": [{"values": ["THIRD_PARTY_ENGAGED"], "operator": "IN", "outcomeKey": "THIRD_PARTY_ENGAGEMENT"}]}]}', 'seed-user-admin-clara', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'CYBERSECURITY'),
	('a1f9a801-2270-4f72-bfd3-1f2f922c0962', '69f712a3-e8de-4236-9383-9cfd4072f846', 1, 'RISK_PROFILE_V1', 'INITIAL_IMPORT', 'DIGITAL_DATA', 'MONITOR_PERFORMANCE_INDICATORS', 'RUN', 'APPROVAL_REQUIRED', 'AI Model Continuous Improvement', 'The AI model of the digital solution must be continuously aligned with the use-case based on the evolution of the input data and monitoring of the model performance in the production environment.', 'DFC-QU-STD-0000534-AI Systems Risk and Compliance Management: https://api-eu.sanofi.com:8443/smartlink/api/qualipso/8038280', 'Monitoring setup to detect data drift, prediction drift and concept drift.', 'When attesting this control, consider the following:

- Is there a monitoring in place to detect data drift (changes in statistical properties of the input data used to train the AI model) and prediction drift (changes in predictive power of the AI model)?
- Is there a process established to monitor concept drift (changes in input/output relationship to identify if the AI model performance has been degraded or the model itself has become stale)?
- In case of alerts detected through the monitoring, are actions taken to ensure continuous robustness of the AI model in alignment with the intended use?
- For digital solution where the AI model is managed by a Third Party, are there appropriate contractual clauses to ensure AI model monitoring is performed and reported to Opella when needed?', 'OUTCOME_TRIGGERED', '{"groups": [{"conditions": [{"values": ["AI_STANDARD", "AI_HIGH"], "operator": "IN", "outcomeKey": "AI_RISK_CLASSIFICATION"}]}]}', 'seed-user-admin-clara', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'AI'),
	('bae92bd5-23dc-4d46-b405-7e91c5ded653', 'e4036424-b3f4-4437-bdba-6114ff455679', 1, 'RISK_PROFILE_V1', 'INITIAL_IMPORT', 'PV', 'PV', 'PLAN', 'APPROVAL_REQUIRED', 'PV Contract', 'The Digital Property outsourced to 3rd Party monitoring should ensure the contract contains the clause which calls out the PV monitoring requirement.', 'DFC-QU-GOP-0000613-Life Cycle Management of Digital Properties', 'Contract with the clause for monitoring', '', 'OUTCOME_TRIGGERED', '{"groups": [{"conditions": [{"values": ["PV"], "operator": "IN", "outcomeKey": "PV"}]}]}', 'seed-user-admin-clara', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'PV'),
	('c31d852e-0abf-423c-8abb-cf84dd0e2856', '7f61f90d-c6dd-467d-9562-4b99945d8b19', 1, 'RISK_PROFILE_V1', 'INITIAL_IMPORT', 'PV', 'PV', 'PLAN', 'APPROVAL_REQUIRED', 'PV Training', 'PV Training is required for Service Providers and Opella staff.', 'DFC-QU-GOP-0000613-Life Cycle Management of Digital Properties', 'Digital PV Packet', '“Digital PV packet” that contains the materials needed for monitoring, including PV training and instructions, guidance for PV data reporting, the PV data reporting form, the PV/PTC contact list, and the PV data reconciliation form. 
The Digital Property ID must also be shared with the service provider or internal staff so it can be added to case reports.', 'OUTCOME_TRIGGERED', '{"groups": [{"conditions": [{"values": ["PV"], "operator": "IN", "outcomeKey": "PV"}]}]}', 'seed-user-admin-clara', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'PV'),
	('1fcd6789-3f53-4acb-b7ab-5ff7adff7f95', '1fce9610-f2cd-4983-9ecc-0e43c8aeceea', 1, 'RISK_PROFILE_V1', 'INITIAL_IMPORT', 'PV', 'PV', 'RUN', 'APPROVAL_REQUIRED', 'PV Monitoring', 'The Digital Property outsourced to 3rd Party for monitoring should ensure the contract contains the clause which calls out the PV monitoring requirement and ensure these requirements are met.', 'DFC-QU-GOP-0000613-Life Cycle Management of Digital Properties', 'Contract with the clause for monitoring', '', 'OUTCOME_TRIGGERED', '{"groups": [{"conditions": [{"values": ["PV"], "operator": "IN", "outcomeKey": "PV"}]}]}', 'seed-user-admin-clara', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', '2026-08-10 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'PV');


